  "reason": "Leaf green and saffron on warm cream with Poppins and generously rounded cards give a calm, earthy, trustworthy feel, while the muted text tones and restrained accents keep it minimal rather than playful.",
  "design_html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n:root {\n  --background: 40.0 52.9% 96.7%;\n  --foreground: 145.7 10.4% 13.1%;\n  --card: 40.0 100.0% 98.2%;\n  --card-foreground: 145.7 10.4% 13.1%;\n  --popover: 40.0 100.0% 98.2%;\n  --popover-foreground: 145.7 10.4% 13.1%;\n  --primary: 157.9 55.1% 27.1%;\n  --primary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --secondary: 212.5 39.9% 30.0%;\n  --secondary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n  --muted-foreground: 130.0 2.7% 43.1%;\n  --accent: 29.8 80.4% 53.9%;\n  --accent-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n  --destructive: 6.0 63.7% 46.5%;\n  --destructive-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n  --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n  --ring: 157.9 55.1% 27.1%;\n  --radius: 0.5rem;\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.06);\n  --shadow: 0 4px 12px -2px hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.10);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 12px 32px -8px hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.14);\n}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-family:'Manrope',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;}\n</style>\n<div> <style>.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}.nav{background:hsl(var(--card));border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border));position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5}.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:4.25rem;gap:1.5rem}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem}.logo{height:2rem;width:2rem;object-fit:contain;border-radius:var(--radius)}.wm{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:hsl(var(--foreground));letter-spacing:-.01em}.links{display:flex;gap:1.75rem}.links a{font-size:.9rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));text-decoration:none}.nav-cta{display:flex;gap:.5rem}.btn{background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));border:0;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:.6rem 1.1rem;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}.btn-o{background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--foreground));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:.6rem 1.1rem;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer}.btn.lg,.btn-o.lg{padding:.8rem 1.4rem;font-size:1rem}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center;padding-top:4.5rem;padding-bottom:4rem}.badge{display:inline-block;background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary));border-radius:9999px;padding:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600}.hero h1{font-size:3.25rem;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:1.25rem 0 1rem;color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.lead{font-size:1.125rem;line-height:1.65;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:0 0 2rem;max-width:34rem}.row{display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.fine{font-size:.82rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin-top:1.5rem}.card{background:hsl(var(--card));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:1.5rem;color:hsl(var(--card-foreground))}.hero-card{box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);padding:1.75rem}.lst-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:1rem}.lst-h h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0;color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.pill{background:hsl(var(--secondary));color:hsl(var(--secondary-foreground));border-radius:9999px;padding:.2rem .65rem;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600}.pill.p{background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary))}.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.75rem;padding:1rem 0;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border));margin-bottom:1rem}.kv div{font-size:.8rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.kv b{display:block;font-size:.95rem;color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-weight:600;margin-top:.15rem}.offer{display:flex;gap:.9rem;padding:.7rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.offer:last-of-type{border-bottom:0}.rank{width:1.75rem;height:1.75rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--muted));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}.offer p{margin:.2rem 0 0;font-size:.8rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));line-height:1.45}.offer strong{font-size:.92rem;color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.meta{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem;font-size:.78rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}code{font-size:.8rem;background:hsl(var(--muted));border-radius:calc(var(--radius) - 2px);padding:.15rem .4rem;color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.sec{padding:4rem 0}.sh{text-align:center;max-width:40rem;margin:0 auto 2.75rem}.sh h2{font-size:2.1rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 .75rem;color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.sh p{margin:0;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));line-height:1.6}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.25rem}.feat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem}.ico{width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius);background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ico svg{width:1.2rem;height:1.2rem}.feat h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin:.25rem 0 0;color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.feat p{margin:0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.55;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.band{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:1.25rem}.steps{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.25rem}.steps span{font-size:.8rem;padding:.4rem .75rem;border-radius:9999px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));background:hsl(var(--background))}.steps span.on{background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));border-color:hsl(var(--primary))}.big{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:hsl(var(--foreground));margin:.5rem 0 .25rem;line-height:1}.stat{font-size:.85rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:0 0 1rem}.assume{font-size:.78rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));padding-top:.85rem;line-height:1.5;margin:0}.foot{background:hsl(var(--card));border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));margin-top:2rem}.foot-in{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:2.25rem 0;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.foot-in .brand .wm{font-size:1.05rem}.foot-in .logo{height:1.6rem;width:1.6rem}.foot small{color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));font-size:.8rem}.foot nav{display:flex;gap:1.5rem}.foot nav a{font-size:.85rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:860px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:2.4rem}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.band{grid-template-columns:1fr}.links{display:none}}</style> <header class=\"nav\"><div class=\"wrap nav-in\"><div class=\"brand\"><img data-nexen-logo src=\"\" alt=\"Annadaan logo\" class=\"logo\"><span class=\"wm\">Annadaan</span></div><nav class=\"links\"><a>How it works</a><a>For donors</a><a>For receivers</a><a>Impact</a><a>Verification</a></nav><div class=\"nav-cta\"><button class=\"btn-o\">Sign in</button><button class=\"btn\">Post surplus</button></div></div></header> <section class=\"wrap hero\"><div><span class=\"badge\">FSSAI-verified donors and receivers</span><h1>Turn surplus food into meals before it spoils.</h1><p class=\"lead\">Annadaan connects caterers' surplus to nearby NGOs, community kitchens and volunteers, with AI-assisted posting and matching. A listing goes live in under 60 seconds.</p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn lg\">Post surplus food</button><button class=\"btn-o lg\">See how matching works</button></div><p class=\"fine\">Every listing carries a handling card: consume-by time, storage, allergens and disclaimer.</p></div> <div class=\"card hero-card\"><div class=\"lst-h\"><h3>Wedding lunch · 80 servings</h3><span class=\"pill p\">Offered</span></div><div class=\"kv\"><div>Consume by<b>21:30 tonight</b></div><div>Storage<b>Hot-held above 60°C</b></div><div>Allergens<b>Contains nuts, dairy</b></div><div>Handover code<b><code>HC-7F3K-29</code></b></div></div><div class=\"offer\"><span class=\"rank\">1</span><div><strong>Sunrise Shelter, 2.1 km</strong><p>Closest receiver with a 45-minute collection window and hot-holding capacity.</p></div></div><div class=\"offer\"><span class=\"rank\">2</span><div><strong>Old Town Community Kitchen, 3.4 km</strong><p>Serves 120 meals tonight and has a volunteer driver free now.</p></div></div><div class=\"meta\"><span>Posted <code>14:05</code></span><span>Volunteer ETA 18 min</span></div></div></section> <section class=\"sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"></section> <section class=\"sec wrap\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"sh\"><h2>From post to proof, in one thread</h2><p>Each rescue moves through clear, live statuses that every party can see, with impact recorded against stated assumptions.</p></div><div class=\"grid\"> <div class=\"card feat\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3v18M3 12h18\"/></svg></div><h3>Post in under 60 seconds</h3><p>Describe the surplus in free text, by voice or in a form. The AI fills the listing and you confirm before it goes out.</p></div> <div class=\"card feat\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7\"/></svg></div><h3>Ranked offers with reasons</h3><p>Nearby receivers are ranked, and each offer explains in plain language why it fits.</p></div> <div class=\"card feat\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg></div><h3>Volunteer assigned with ETA</h3><p>Accept an offer and a volunteer driver is assigned with a live arrival estimate.</p></div> <div class=\"card feat\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg></div><h3>One-time handover code</h3><p>The donor shares a single code at collection, so every pickup is verified before food leaves.</p></div> <div class=\"card feat\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5 9-10\"/></svg></div><h3>Confirm servings on delivery</h3><p>Receivers confirm servings received, closing the loop and updating impact totals.</p></div> <div class=\"card feat\"><div class=\"ico\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-8M22 20H2\"/></svg></div><h3>Impact by zone</h3><p>Sponsors and donors see meals rescued, CO₂ avoided and weekly reports, with assumptions shown.</p></div> </div></section> <section class=\"sec wrap\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"band\"><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"pill\">Live status</span><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin:.9rem 0 .25rem;color:hsl(var(--foreground))\">Track every rescue as it moves</h2><p class=\"stat\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem\">Status updates reach the donor, receiver and volunteer the moment they change.</p><div class=\"steps\"><span class=\"on\">Posted</span><span class=\"on\">Offered</span><span class=\"on\">Claimed</span><span>Collected</span><span>Delivered</span><span>Expired</span><span>Cancelled</span></div></div> <div class=\"card\"><span class=\"pill\">This week · Zone 4</span><div class=\"big\">1,286</div><p class=\"stat\">meals rescued across 37 handovers</p><p class=\"assume\">Assumes 0.6 kg per serving and 2.1 kg CO₂e per kg diverted. Rule set v3.2, edited by platform admin.</p></div></div></section> <footer class=\"foot\"><div class=\"wrap foot-in\"><div class=\"brand\"><img data-nexen-logo src=\"\" alt=\"Annadaan logo\" class=\"logo\"><span class=\"wm\">Annadaan</span></div><nav><a>Donors</a><a>Receivers</a><a>CSR sponsors</a><a>Privacy</a></nav><small>© Annadaan. Surplus food, delivered with care.</small></div></footer> </div>",
